    "competing_cache": "The GPU HBM step cannot be the CPU online-trie allocation itself. The final SWA pool had only 982 free tokens while 4,820,278 SWA tokens had been evicted; final full-KV availability was 5,852. Per-time corpus operations and simultaneous cache occupancy are therefore required to separate corpus saturation from SWA/KV churn.",
    "ngram": "NGRAMWorker retains one process-global NgramCorpus; every verify enqueues an 18-token-tail batch_put and the next prepare synchronizes the asynchronous insert worker before batch_get. Trie construction preallocates all 10,000,000 TrieNode objects; only reset clears online trie and match state."
